    case WCon{+a0, WCon{+a1, WCon{+a2, WCon{+a3, WNil{}}}}}: (0n, ({==}, bv4_g(hl, ehl, a0, a1, a2, a3)))
def rs_bv4(+hl: Nat, +ehl: {hl == 64n : Nat}, +o: T.Bitvector4, +rp: rp_bv4(o)) -> RR.roots(v_bv4(o), S.BitVector{4n}, [D.bytes(d_bv4(hl, o))]):
  match o:
    case T.Bitvector4{+w0}:
      %Equal.sym(U32, w0, U32{WSp.join(4n, 28n, WSp.take(4n, 32n, PD.bits(w0)), Word.zero(28n))}, rp) :
        RR.roots(S.BitsValue{BLP.btk(4n, BLP.bitsof([_]))}, S.BitVector{4n}, [D.bytes(D.D{B.swap32(_), 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0})])
      rsh_bv4(hl, ehl, WSp.take(4n, 32n, PD.bits(w0)))

# ---- l16777216_HistoricalSummary: list of HistoricalSummary (Data elements) ----
def xat_l16777216_HistoricalSummary(W: List<&2, T.HistoricalSummary>, +i: Nat) -> T.HistoricalSummary:
  match W:
    case Nil{}: T.HistoricalSummary_default()
    case Con{+x, t}:
